# This repository carries two unrelated package trees on separate branch
# lines. Checking out `main-nodejs` in a clone that previously had a Python
# branch checked out leaves the Python package's `mcp_observatory/` and
# `tests/` directories behind as untracked files, and `git add -A` would
# commit the entire Python package and its test suite into this npm
# package. Both entries are anchored at the repository root: this package's
# own TypeScript tests live at `src/tests/` (compiled to `dist/tests/`) and
# are deliberately not matched.
/mcp_observatory/
/tests/
